      "delta": "## Plan\n\n"
    }
  },
  {
    "sessionKey": "3f9a1c2e-7b4d-4e8f-9a6b-2c1d0e5f7a8b",
    "seq": 13,
    "event": {
      "type": "textDelta",
      "messageId": "msg-2",
      "contentIndex": 1,
      "delta": "`parse` calls `Config::from` without checking for empty input. I will:\n\n"
    }
  },
  {
    "sessionKey": "3f9a1c2e-7b4d-4e8f-9a6b-2c1d0e5f7a8b",
    "seq": 14,
    "event": {
      "type": "textDelta",
      "messageId": "msg-2",
      "contentIndex": 1,
      "delta": "1. Return `Option<Config>` from `parse`.\n2. Add a regression test for blank input.\n\n"
    }
  },
  {
    "sessionKey": "3f9a1c2e-7b4d-4e8f-9a6b-2c1d0e5f7a8b",
    "seq": 15,
    "event": {
      "type": "textDelta",
      "messageId": "msg-2",
      "contentIndex": 1,
      "delta": "```rust\npub fn parse(input: &str) -> Option<Config> {\n    if input.trim().is_empty() {\n        return None;\n    }\n    Some(Config::from(input))\n}\n```\n\n"
    }
  },
  {
    "sessionKey": "3f9a1c2e-7b4d-4e8f-9a6b-2c1d0e5f7a8b",
    "seq": 16,
    "event": {
      "type": "textDelta",
      "messageId": "msg-2",
      "contentIndex": 1,
      "delta": "The TypeScript caller only needs a null check:\n\n"
    }
  },
  {
    "sessionKey": "3f9a1c2e-7b4d-4e8f-9a6b-2c1d0e5f7a8b",
    "seq": 17,
    "event": {
      "type": "textDelta",
      "messageId": "msg-2",
      "contentIndex": 1,
      "delta": "```ts\nconst config = parse(text);\nif (config === null) showEmptyState();\n```\n\n"
    }
  },
  {
    "sessionKey": "3f9a1c2e-7b4d-4e8f-9a6b-2c1d0e5f7a8b",
    "seq": 18,
